  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Alteration; <strong>CL</strong> 6th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> shoulders; <strong>Price</strong> 8,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis cloak, made from the hide of a slain warg, grants the wearer the ability to assume its likeness. This item functions as an apparatus of Alteration with the Animalistic Transformation talent (limited to the shape of a warg) and grants darkvision 60 feet as an additional trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Alteration sphere (Animalistic Transformation (transformation)); <strong>Cost</strong> 4,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses#toc53\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
